editor.nod_help.chg.extra=<h2>chg 示例</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> 更改文本开头或某个模式。适用于电话号码、代码、前缀和旧编号转换表。</p><div class="notice"><b>结构:</b> 左侧 = 要查找的内容，右侧 = 新形式。包含空格、逗号或特殊字符时请使用引号。</div><details open><summary>替换前缀</summary><table><tr><th>目标</th><th>规则</th><th>示例</th></tr><tr><td>Prefix</td><td><code>chg "01751","07051"</code></td><td><code>0175112345</code> -> <code>0705112345</code></td></tr><tr><td>Dash</td><td><code>chg "01751-","070-51"</code></td><td><code>01751-12345</code> -> <code>070-5112345</code></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>带 x 的模式</summary><p>NOD 2.0：<code>x</code> 捕获一个数字，并在右侧重新放回。左侧的空格和连字符只用于提高可读性。</p><pre>chg "0183x-xx xx","0183-x0 xx xx"</pre><p><code>01835-1234</code> -> <code>0183-501234</code>.</p></details><details><summary>常见错误</summary><ul><li>具体规则放在通用规则上面。</li><li>不要忘记逗号。</li><li>完整值翻译请使用 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>。</li></ul></details>
editor.nod_help.math.extra=<h2>Math 简要说明</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a> 使用 <code>ans</code> 计算。第一行中 <code>ans</code> 是输入值；后续行中它是上一次的结果。</p><div class="notice"><b>结构:</b> 先选择计算类型，再写对应的 syntax。较大的公式可以使用括号或多行 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>。</div><div class="math-flow"><span class="math-pill">1. 基本运算</span><span class="math-pill">2. 函数和常量</span><span class="math-pill">3. 复杂公式</span><span class="math-pill">4. 微积分：diff、integral、limit</span></div><details open><summary>基本运算</summary><table><tr><th>目标</th><th>Syntax</th><th>示例</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td><code>math ans + number</code></td><td><code>math ans + 32</code></td></tr><tr><td>-</td><td><code>math ans - number</code></td><td><code>math ans - 10</code></td></tr><tr><td>*</td><td><code>math ans * factor</code></td><td><code>math ans * 1.8</code></td></tr><tr><td>/</td><td><code>math ans / factor</code></td><td><code>math ans / 1.95583</code></td></tr></table><pre>Name Euro to cents&#13;&#10;input1 Euro&#13;&#10;input2 Cents&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math ans * 100&#13;&#10;end</pre></details><details><summary>函数和常量</summary><table><tr><th>Groep</th><th>Syntax</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td><code>math ans^2</code> or <code>math pow(ans,3)</code></td><td>Square, cube.</td></tr><tr><td>Root</td><td><code>math sqrt(ans)</code></td><td>Can be used inside formulas.</td></tr><tr><td>Pi/e</td><td><code>math pi * ans^2</code><br><code>math e^ans</code></td><td>Circle and exponential.</td></tr><tr><td>Degrees</td><td><code>math sind(ans)</code><br><code>math cosd(ans)</code></td><td>Use <code>sin/cos/tan</code> for radians.</td></tr></table></details><details><summary>复杂公式</summary><p>当计算顺序很重要时使用括号。乘法始终用 <code>*</code> 明确写出。</p><pre>math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;math ((ans + 10) * 2) / 3&#13;&#10;math ans * (1 + 0.04)^5</pre><h3>示例：勾股定理</h3><div class="mathml-formula"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></div><pre>Name Hypotenuse&#13;&#10;input1 Side a&#13;&#10;input2 Side c&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;end</pre><p>这里 <code>ans</code> 是边 <code>a</code>；另一条边固定为 <code>5</code>。</p></details><details><summary>微积分：diff、integral、limit</summary><table><tr><th>目标</th><th>Syntax</th><th>结果</th></tr><tr><td>Derivative</td><td><code>math diff ans^2</code></td><td>数值斜率。</td></tr><tr><td>Integral</td><td><code>math integral 0,1 ans^2</code></td><td>从 0 到 1 的数值面积。</td></tr><tr><td>Limit</td><td><code>math limit 0 sin(ans)/ans</code></td><td>0 附近的近似值。</td></tr></table></details><h2>常见错误</h2><ul><li>不要忘记 <code>ans</code>。</li><li>角度请使用 <code>sind</code>。</li><li>复杂反向转换请使用 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:reverse"><code>reverse</code></a>。</li></ul>
editor.nod_help.mode.extra=<h2>什么时候使用 mode？</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a> 说明正在创建哪种 NOD 文件。普通转换器通常不需要它。</p><div class="notice"><b>结构:</b> 只有特殊类型才使用 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a>，例如数据处理或解方程。</div><details open><summary>Modes</summary><table><tr><th>Mode</th><th>何时</th><th>命令</th></tr><tr><td><code>mode calculator</code></td><td>普通转换器</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a></td></tr><tr><td><code>mode data</code></td><td>数据处理</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:table"><code>table</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:field"><code>field</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:output"><code>output</code></a></td></tr><tr><td><code>mode equation</code></td><td>解方程</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>示例: converter</summary><pre>Name Celsius to Fahrenheit&#13;&#10;input1 Celsius&#13;&#10;input2 Fahrenheit&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math ans * 1.8&#13;&#10;math ans + 32&#13;&#10;end</pre></details><details><summary>示例: equation</summary><pre>Name Solve equation&#13;&#10;mode equation&#13;&#10;given y = 20&#13;&#10;equation y = x * 2&#13;&#10;solve x&#13;&#10;constraint x >= 0&#13;&#10;end</pre></details>
editor.nod_help.trans.extra=<h2>trans 示例</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a> 翻译一个完整值。适用于单词、固定代码、状态、邮编和短列表。</p><div class="notice"><b>结构:</b> <code>trans "old value","new value"</code>. 完整输入必须匹配左侧值。</div><details open><summary>翻译精确文本</summary><table><tr><th>目标</th><th>规则</th><th>结果</th></tr><tr><td>Word</td><td><code>trans "hallo","hello"</code></td><td><code>hallo</code> -> <code>hello</code></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><code>trans "open","in progress"</code></td><td><code>open</code> -> <code>in progress</code></td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td><code>trans "2566 GB 241","Nieboerweg 241, 2566 GB Den Haag"</code></td><td>postcode + house number -> address</td></tr></table></details><details><summary>trans / chg</summary><table><tr><th>命令</th><th>何时</th><th>示例</th></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a></td><td>完整输入值是精确已知的。</td><td><code>hallo</code> -> <code>hello</code></td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a></td><td>只有开头或模式发生变化。</td><td><code>01751-xxxxx</code> -> <code>070-51xxxxx</code></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>常见错误</summary><ul><li>左侧是输入，右侧是输出。</li><li>部分变化请使用 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a>。</li><li>避免为同一个输入创建重复翻译。</li></ul></details>
editor.nod_help.full.classic=<h2>NOD 编辑器介绍</h2><p>NOD 编辑器是制作转换器的工作区。上方编写代码，下方测试输入和输出，右侧实时预览显示标签、符号、介绍文本和结果。</p><h2>经典 1.73 与 NOD 2.0</h2><table><tr><th>Syscalculator 1.73 / NOD 1.0</th><th>Syscalculator 2.0 / NOD 编辑器</th></tr><tr><td>经典文本文件，包含 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:name"><code>Name</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input1"><code>input1</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input2"><code>input2</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> 和 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a>。</td><td>同样的基础仍然兼容旧 NOD 文件。</td></tr><tr><td>符号位置经常需要记住后再测试。</td><td>预览会立即显示 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb1"><code>Symb1</code></a> 到 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb4"><code>Symb4</code></a> 的位置。</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> 主要用于前缀替换。</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> 保持兼容；NOD 2.0 增加带 <code>x</code> 捕获的模式。</td></tr><tr><td>帮助主要来自示例和经验。</td><td>编辑器提供输入建议、右键帮助和按类型整理的示例页面。</td></tr></table><h2>语法：NOD 1.0 和 NOD 2.0 完整概览</h2><p>此表显示哪些语法来自经典 NOD 文件，以及 NOD 2.0 新增了什么。</p><table class="syntax-compare"><tr><th>Syntax / feature</th><th>NOD 1.0</th><th>NOD 2.0</th><th>Note</th></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:name"><code>Name</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Converter name/title.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:urln"><code>URLN</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Reference/source line remains supported.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input1"><code>input1</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input2"><code>input2</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Labels for input and output.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:result"><code>Result</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:resfou"><code>Resfou</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Result label and error text.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb1"><code>Symb1</code></a> through <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb4"><code>Symb4</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Symbols left/right of input and output; NOD 2.0 shows them in preview.</td></tr><tr><td><code>format #.00</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Number formatting stays the same.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode calculator</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>NOD 2.0 uses <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a> for special file types; normal converters also work without mode.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode data</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>For table/field processing.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode equation</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>For solving equations with <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>math ans * 1.8</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Classic calculation with <code>ans</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Richer formulas and functions in NOD 2.0.</td></tr><tr><td><code>chg "01751-","070-51"</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Classic prefix replacement keeps working.</td></tr><tr><td><code>chg "0183x-xx xx","0183-x0 xx xx"</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>New in NOD 2.0: pattern with <code>x</code> capture.</td></tr><tr><td><code>trans "old","new"</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Exact text translation remains compatible.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:reverse"><code>reverse</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Reverse direction of a converter.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:table"><code>table</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:field"><code>field</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:output"><code>output</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>NOD 2.0 data converters with fields and output construction.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:phoneformat"><code>phoneformat</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Format phone numbers in data/number converters.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:lookup"><code>lookup</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:match"><code>match</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Look up tables or connect values.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:constraint"><code>constraint</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Solve equations with constraints.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:preview"><code>preview</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:backup"><code>backup</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Editor/safety information for NOD 2.0 files.</td></tr><tr><td><code>indoprint ... indoend</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Introduction text remains supported.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Closes the NOD file.</td></tr><tr><td>Live preview, suggestions, right-click help</td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>This is editor help, not old runtime syntax.</td></tr></table><h2>保持不变</h2><ul><li>命令仍按行书写，易读。</li><li><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a> 关闭文件。</li><li>简单转换器仍然很短。</li></ul><h2>新增内容</h2><ul><li>实时预览和转换器模拟器。</li><li>Graph 2D：用于 math 转换器图形。</li><li>输入时显示建议。</li><li>每个命令有更完整的帮助。</li><li>为 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>、<a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a>、符号和 <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:indoprint"><code>indoprint</code></a> 提供更多示例。</li></ul>
